        "--- \n",
        "## STEP 5 (Part 4 of Assignment): Try ONE Method to Rescue the DO Sensor\n",
        "**Action:** In the code box below, set `RESCUE_OPTION` to **`1`**, **`2`**, **`3`**, or **`4`**, and click the **Play button (\u25b6)**:\n",
